" Copy this file to custom/plugins.vim.  The local file is intentionally
" ignored by Git so Onesimus updates never compete with personal plugins.

" Plug 'wakatime/vim-wakatime'

" Follow a plugin's default branch instead of the distribution's reviewed pin.
" Keep its loading options and build hooks; plain Plug overrides the pin.
" Plug 'BaksiLi/texinsitu.vim', {'do': ':TexInsituInstall'}

" Cogitatum inquiry notes. OnesimusPlugin applies the reviewed source pin.
" Use a CLI built from the compiler revision listed in that plugin's README.
" call OnesimusPlugin('BaksiLi/vim-cogitatum', { 'do': 'npm ci && npm run build' })

" Developing a plugin locally: map its name to a checkout in
" g:onesimus_plugin_overrides. Set it in custom/settings.vim, which loads
" before the distribution declares mdtoc.vim, webpreview.vim and texinsitu.vim.
" Local builds remain explicit; PlugUpdate leaves the checkout alone.
